Quill here. Three taps and you have a study plan. Not sure and Skip are always there.
```yui
plan@first "Your first study plan" submit="Build my plan"
choose@topic "What are you learning?" "A language"|"A school subject"|"A skill for work"|"Something for fun"|"Not sure"|"Skip" +other
choose@minutes "How many minutes a day?" "10 minutes"|"20 minutes"|"30 minutes"|"An hour"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
choose@quiz "How do you like to be quizzed?" "Flash cards"|"Multiple choice"|"Write it out"|"Out loud"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
end
```
